    "purpose": "Joint conformance fixture for the AP2 PQC extension proposal (#250). AlgoVoi supplies canonical bytes + ECDSA (ES256) + Ed25519 + Falcon-1024 (FIPS 206) signatures over a single AP2 PaymentMandate canonical payload. @rayc0 supplies ML-DSA-65 (FIPS 204) over the IDENTICAL canonical byte sequence plus the 240-vector ML-DSA-65 test set.\n\nBy construction both fixture halves anchor to one canonical payload, so the JCS+SHA-256 substrate determinism is independent of the signature scheme â€” exactly the cross-implementor agreement @rayc0 and @chopmob-cloud locked in on #250 on 2026-05-16.",
