      "1. Compute JCS_bytes = rfc8785(mandate_body).",
      "2. Confirm base64(JCS_bytes) == expected_jcs_bytes_b64.",
      "3. Confirm sha256_hex(JCS_bytes) == expected_canonical_sha256.",
      "4. For each signature, verify against the published public key over JCS_bytes."
    ]
  },
